{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Run Chicken Run",
    "steam_appid": 3593400,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593400/extras/80a24e0aac3c15630d457c2f9ed6f93a.avif?t=1754905259\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593400/extras/b68ec490d2af30d6ad1445b058120b87.webp?t=1754905259\" width=300 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Run Chicken Run&quot; is a simple and fun action game. The first customer (hunter) who catches and delivers the chicken will win the game. If the chicken is not caught, it will grow over time and eventually escape by flying over the fence. After the chicken is caught, other hunters will then target the player who caught the chicken and is trying to deliver it to the restaurant. Hurry up, but be careful \u2014 the surrounding objects\u00a0can\u00a0hurt\u00a0you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593400/extras/d96523d898c92f80ed1fbecbf28bc313.webp?t=1754905259\" width=300 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game mode where you play as a chicken, you can jump farther by screaming and when you are caught you can scramble to get free. Yes, you did not hear wrong, you can use this ability by making Bawk Bawk (Chicken clucking sound) on the microphone in real life. Just be careful, you can also give away\u00a0your\u00a0location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593400/extras/1221cb78f8cc8a12513af88a8d24d3a1.webp?t=1754905259\" width=300 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the beginning, the game will be playable in Co-op mode (one player as the chicken, others as hunters). You can create private rooms to play with your own friends. There will be an active player pool, and if you wish, you can also join games in other rooms. It's a great opportunity to meet\u00a0new\u00a0people!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593400/extras/a3d8354617dce2e36f1b203bdc203314.webp?t=1754905259\" width=300 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For Hunters</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item throwing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slapping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interacting with environmental items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taking damage (from other players)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For the Chicken</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scale mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using the microphone (making chicken sounds \u2013 optional)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interacting with environmental\u00a0items</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593400/extras/80a24e0aac3c15630d457c2f9ed6f93a.avif?t=1754905259\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593400/extras/b68ec490d2af30d6ad1445b058120b87.webp?t=1754905259\" width=300 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Run Chicken Run&quot; is a simple and fun action game. The first customer (hunter) who catches and delivers the chicken will win the game. If the chicken is not caught, it will grow over time and eventually escape by flying over the fence. After the chicken is caught, other hunters will then target the player who caught the chicken and is trying to deliver it to the restaurant. Hurry up, but be careful \u2014 the surrounding objects\u00a0can\u00a0hurt\u00a0you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593400/extras/d96523d898c92f80ed1fbecbf28bc313.webp?t=1754905259\" width=300 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game mode where you play as a chicken, you can jump farther by screaming and when you are caught you can scramble to get free. Yes, you did not hear wrong, you can use this ability by making Bawk Bawk (Chicken clucking sound) on the microphone in real life. Just be careful, you can also give away\u00a0your\u00a0location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593400/extras/1221cb78f8cc8a12513af88a8d24d3a1.webp?t=1754905259\" width=300 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the beginning, the game will be playable in Co-op mode (one player as the chicken, others as hunters). You can create private rooms to play with your own friends. There will be an active player pool, and if you wish, you can also join games in other rooms. It's a great opportunity to meet\u00a0new\u00a0people!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593400/extras/a3d8354617dce2e36f1b203bdc203314.webp?t=1754905259\" width=300 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For Hunters</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item throwing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slapping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interacting with environmental items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taking damage (from other players)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For the Chicken</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scale mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using the microphone (making chicken sounds \u2013 optional)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interacting with environmental\u00a0items</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "\u201cRun Chicken Run\u201d is an online co-op action and simple entertainment game.In the game you and your allies have to chase the chicken to catch the one that escaped from the table. You have to get the chicken to the restaurant and deliver it to the cook before it escapes from the garden.",
